# Jak 1's ocean and shadow in each eye (item 12): the ocean and Jak 1's shadows come from the game already on the screen,
# as seen from between the eyes; each eye reprojects them (jak_vr.cpp reproject_matrix). On Geyser Rock in first
# person, the head turned round to the sea and down a little (oc-<yaw>), then down at Jak's feet for his shadow
# (oc-shadow). In the -left and -right pictures the near water must sit with the sand beside it: the same shift between
# the eyes where they meet, no gap or seam at the shore that one eye has and the other does not.
